  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Application Structure**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on the application structure within the `src/` directory. I\'m starting to identify necessary components and state, beginning with defining the data types in `src/types/index.ts`. This includes enumerating the navigation views for the application such as \'public-landing\', \'security-trust\', etc.\n\n\n**Outlining Portal Components**\n\nI\'m now detailing the components of the \'portal\' module. I\'ve defined screen display modes for desktop and mobile, with auto-detection and preview toggle. I\'ve also listed telemetry, ledger, and other data types that need representation. The HologramCanvas component will render the 3D core canvas, incorporating an icosahedron projection, an orbiting ring, and other interactive elements. Finally, the PublicLanding component will handle responsive views.\n\n\n**Detailing Secure Architecture**\n\nI\'m now detailing the application\'s secure architecture. I am focusing on the audit request modal and the \"Explorar Arquitectura\" smooth scroll feature. The telemetry metrics will be displayed with an embedded Hologram canvas overlayed with badges. I am working on defining the Stack Arquitect\303\263nico Blindado cards, specifying Hardware Root-of-Trust and security measures for each node. I\'m detailing the Security & Trust Center, which has an interactive SVG diagram showcasing Shamir\'s Secret Sharing.\n\n\n**Defining Security Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the security elements. I\'ve designed status badges like \"QUORUM SATISFIED: 3/5 NODES SIGNED\" for quorum status. I\'ve also detailed cryptographic contracts for terms, privacy policies, and SLA. I\'m fleshing out the Alpha-1 Access Portal, including the handshake terminal box with live TLS 1.3 / FIDO2 challenge, and the \'Verificar Token Hardware\' button. Lastly, I\'m outlining high-contrast audit metrics and the cookie/telemetry consent banner. I\'ve also begun sketching out the AdminEnclave components.\n\n\n**Defining Dashboard KPIs**\n\nI\'m now detailing the dashboard\'s key performance indicators. I\'ve specified HSM YUBI-V4 security with TLS 1.3 and ECDSA P-384. I\'m assigning \"Jefe\" and \"Socio\" badges for SuperAdmin roles. The plan is to include a \"RE-AUTH SESI\303\223N\" button that opens a credentials modal. I\'ve also added Quick Navigation Chips and sketched out a 4 KPI Bento Grid. I\'m focusing on interactive visualizations like SVG areas, sparklines, split bars, and dual-area curves for representing financial metrics, leads, and Kali security status. I am also working on an audited ledger table.\n\n\n**Defining Engineering Progress**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Pipeline & Proyectos de Ingenier\303\255a,\" using an interactive 3-column Kanban board, with drag-and-drop ticket interactions for the \"Leads Redes Sociales,\" \"SLA Draft & Firmas,\" and \"Progreso Ingenier\303\255a\" tasks. I\'ve designed a \"Nuevo Ticket\" modal. I\'m also adding a Kali Linux Daemon with a live terminal stream, including automatic log appending and interactive command input. Finally, I\'ve designed a \"Gestor de Gobernanza Ra\303\255z & Permisos SLA\" that allows global session revocation and multi-factor authentication.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1048767"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"export type ActiveView = \'public\' | \'admin\';\\n\\nexport type ScreenMode = \'responsive\' | \'mobile-mock\' | \'desktop-mock\';\\n\\nexport interface LedgerEntry {\\n  id: string;\\n  client: string;\\n  amount: number;\\n  currency: string;\\n  service: string;\\n  gateway: \'Stripe Escrow (Dual)\' | \'SPEI Inmediato Banxico\';\\n  gatewayType: \'stripe\' | \'spei\';\\n  hash: string;\\n  status: \'LEDGER OK\' | \'PENDING\' | \'DISPERSED\';\\n  timestamp: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface KanbanTicket {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  category: string;\\n  categoryBadge: string;\\n  categoryBadgeColor: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  amountEst?: string;\\n  leadScore?: number;\\n  slaNote?: string;\\n  status: \'leads\' | \'negotiation\' | \'active\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EngineeringTask {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  percentage: number;\\n  note: string;\\n  color: \'cyan\' | \'green\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ShardNode {\\n  id: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  location: string;\\n  active: boolean;\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating src/types/index.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create types file\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
