reGuard & Cilium\', desc: \'eBPF Mesh Encrypted Tunnel\', icon: \'vpn_key\', color: \'text-[#e1e0ff]\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const contracts = [\\n    {\\n      title: \'T\303\251rminos Institucionales\',\\n      version: \'V4.2.1\',\\n      ref: \'#MCRA-TC-2025-V4\',\\n      hash: \'8f9a2e3184dc921f009e4c8b21ad9c08928014e7f94bbcd29910ca84e03f9011\',\\n      description: \'Marco contractual que rige la provisi\303\263n de microservicios blindados y acuerdos de no divulgaci\303\263n criptogr\303\241fica con hardware HSM.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      title: \'Pol\303\255ticas de Privacidad\',\\n      version: \'ZERO-RETENTION\',\\n      ref: \'#MCRA-PRIV-SEC (GDPR/Swiss-Aligned)\',\\n      hash: \'d13e54b8109312bcfe830209419abce742910fa7281048bceee2084920401830\',\\n      description: \'Garant\303\255a matem\303\241tica de cero retenci\303\263n de memoria residual. Destrucci\303\263n de claves ef\303\255meras tras cada handshake.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      title: \'SLA de Resiliencia y Datos\',\\n      version: \'SLA 99.999%\',\\n      ref: \'#MCRA-SLA-RPO-RTO-ZERO\',\\n      hash: \'33a01fb910408dcaee8091bc24810287114efcba81048201840291ba09183419\',\\n      description: \'Acuerdo de nivel de servicio con penalizaciones autom\303\241ticas liquidadas v\303\255a contratos inteligentes y doble dispersi\303\263n escrow.\',\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col w-full relative\\\">\\n      {/* Background Matrix Pattern Layer */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(#00e5ff_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px]\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Top Ambient Glow */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute -top-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3/4 max-w-5xl h-96 bg-[#00e5ff]/10 blur-[130px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10\\\"></div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 w-f